Z||000000||mope||02-04-2001||09:02 PM||||HEY<P>I have a 86 GT 4spd<P>the emergency brake is stuck (not engaged).<BR>so i rolled under the car and noticed that the cable was all rotted out and the one in the back was half missing. Was there a safty recall for this? If not does someone have new replacement parts for repair? About how much would it cost to change out and how hard you all think this would be to do?<P>thanks a bunch<P>m0pe||||reg||4
